      },
      "title": "Model files",
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Pika H3 Flex — model files\n\nExpects the int8-convrot MiniMax H3 bases already present in `models/diffusion_models/`.\n\n| slot | file |\n|---|---|\n| FL2VA base | `minimax_h3_{fl2va,ref2va}_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors` |\n| Pika adapter | `pika_h3_flex_{fl2va,ref2va}_v1_bf16.safetensors` (rank 128, ~1.96 GB) |\n| text encoder | `qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors` (`CLIPLoader` type = `minimax`) |\n| video VAE | `minimax_h3_video_vae_int8_convrot.safetensors` |\n| audio VAE | `minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors` |\n\nThe adapter touches the attn `qkv_proj` / `out_proj` and `mlp.fc1` / `fc2` of all 50 blocks plus the 2\ntoken-refiner blocks. Loader is `LoraLoaderModelOnly` at strength **1.0** — no `LoraLoader` (this model has no\nseparate text-encoder LoRA keys).\n\nNo image input on this variant: the prompt has to carry the whole scene.\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Pika H3 Flex — model files\n\nExpects the int8-convrot MiniMax H3 bases already present in `models/diffusion_models/`.\n\n| slot | file |\n|---|---|\n| FL2VA base | `minimax_h3_{fl2va,ref2va}_pruned_int8_convrot.safetensors` |\n| Pika adapter | `pika_h3_flex_{fl2va,ref2va}_v1_bf16.safetensors` (rank 128, ~1.96 GB) |\n| text encoder | `qwen3vl_32b_minimax_h3_nvfp4_awq.safetensors` (`CLIPLoader` type = `minimax`) |\n| video VAE | `minimax_h3_video_vae_int8_convrot.safetensors` |\n| audio VAE | `minimax_h3_audio_vae_fp32.safetensors` |\n\nThe adapter touches the attn `qkv_proj` / `out_proj` and `mlp.fc1` / `fc2` of all 50 blocks plus the 2\ntoken-refiner blocks. Loader is `LoraLoaderModelOnly` at strength **1.0** — no `LoraLoader` (this model has no\nseparate text-encoder LoRA keys).\n\nNo image input on this variant: the prompt has to carry the whole scene.\n"
      }
    },
