      "title": "Text to video",
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Text to video (t2v) variant\n\nSame Pika H3 Flex stack as `pika_h3_flex_fl2va.json`, with the image inputs removed.\n\n| input | state |\n|---|---|\n| `first_frame` | **not connected** (optional slot, left open on purpose) |\n| `last_frame` | **not connected** (optional slot, left open on purpose) |\n\n- `MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo` stays the same node — the official MiniMax H3 t2v template uses this\n  node with both IMAGE slots unconnected, so text alone drives the latent.\n- The prompt must therefore be **self-contained**: no `<Picture N>` tokens, no \"as shown in the\n  first frame\" wording. There is no image to reference.\n- Width / height / length are still plain node widgets (1344 x 768 / 124 frames).\n  Do **not** wire `ResolutionSelector` in — it rewrites the canvas to 864 x 480 at 0.4 MP.\n- Want image conditioning back? Drop a `LoadImage` into the `first_frame` slot; everything else\n  can stay as it is.\n"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653",
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Text to video (t2v) variant\n\nSame Pika H3 Flex stack as `pika_h3_flex_fl2va.json`, with the image inputs removed.\n\n| input | state |\n|---|---|\n| `first_frame` | **not connected** (optional slot, left open on purpose) |\n| `last_frame` | **not connected** (optional slot, left open on purpose) |\n\n- `MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo` stays the same node — the official MiniMax H3 t2v template uses this\n  node with both IMAGE slots unconnected, so text alone drives the latent.\n- The prompt must therefore be **self-contained**: no `<Picture N>` tokens, no \"as shown in the\n  first frame\" wording. There is no image to reference.\n- Width / height / length are still plain node widgets (1344 x 768 / 124 frames).\n  Do **not** wire `ResolutionSelector` in — it rewrites the canvas to 864 x 480 at 0.4 MP.\n- Want image conditioning back? Drop a `LoadImage` into the `first_frame` slot; everything else\n  can stay as it is.\n"
      }
    }
